// task: a let followed by a filter that begins with a negative literal
// kind: lookups-and-filters
// expect: refuse-with-fix:$p.age  (-1) < $x
// rfc: §3 arithmetic
// note: a filter may not begin with `-`, but after a let the ladder takes the `-` first, so the let's value silently becomes a comparison
// amended: `$p.age  -1` is refused (RFC §3, 2026-11-08); the intended text is a let, then the filter
query q() {
  match { $p: Person  let $x = $p.age  -1 < $x }
  return { $p.name }
}
